---
title: Text projection
---

## Overview {#sec-overview}

A paragraph that points at @fig-scree, so the projection must show the resolved
figure number rather than the raw `@`-reference.

::: {.callout-note}
## Heads up

Callouts carry a kind, and the text projection labels them by it.
:::

![A scree plot of the eigenvalues.](scree.png){#fig-scree}

The relation is exact:

$$E = mc^2$$

```{python}
x = 1
print(x)
```
